--TEST--
hovering one segment of a `propertyPath<T>` literal shows the property that segment names, on the class the path reached there, and its `///` run — `rule:ide/a-field-path-completes-one-segment-at-a-time`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Customer {
    /// The name printed on the invoice.
    public string $name = "Ada";
}
class Order {
    public string $id = "o1";
    public ?Customer $customer = null;
}
class Grid {
    public static function sortBy(propertyPath<Order> $column): string {
        return $column as string;
    }
}

echo Grid::sortBy("customer.na<|>me");
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
```nvs
class Customer { public string $name }
```

The name printed on the invoice.
